# Keeps host state out of the build context/image. Two hard guarantees matter
# here: (1) secrets (.env) are NEVER baked into an image, and (2) host
# node_modules/dist are not copied in, because each stage runs `npm ci` + build
# from the lockfile and must not inherit another platform's binaries.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage

# Environment / secrets — configure via runtime env, never the image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS / tooling / local artifacts
.git
.gitignore
.github
*.log
.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.vscode
.idea
Spirit-*.md
